<title>UK: SOCCER-PEDERSEN SIGNS FOR BLACKBURN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PEDERSEN SIGNS FOR BLACKBURN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish striker Per Pedersen completed a 2.5 million pounds ($4 million) move from Odense to Blackburn Rovers on Friday.</p>
<p>Pedersen, who recently scored four times for Denmark in a friendly against the United States, will be included in the squad to face Liverpool on Saturday if international clearance is obtained in time.</p>
</text>
